laurel boot menu: UniXNU entry "Android" (action laurel-android), retries refill before an iOS boot only after a real key event, self-check line, Power-held guard, button text. docs/laurel_sprout/boot-menu.md.

diff --git a/package/UniXNUPkg/Library/UniXNULib/Boot.c b/package/UniXNUPkg/Library/UniXNULib/Boot.c
